WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Let's take a quick look at how to
upgrade your Google Compute Engine instance

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.140
It's super easy to upgrade your instance.
The first step is to stop the instance,

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.830
then click Edit to edit the instance

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.790
choose a predefined machine type or
customize to pick how much CPU and

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.560
memory you need

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.710
scroll down and click Save

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.360
now scroll back up

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.620
and click Start. That's it!

